## Wake up on your balcony

Our bright, modern studio with a balcony is made for couples who want comfort and a little more room. A comfortable double bed, a fully equipped kitchenette with Nespresso coffee, and your own balcony to start the day with a coffee and a view. Great value for short and long stays.
